        "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐⭐⭐ <strong>This game is part of the Cozy &amp; Emotional Stories bundle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the complete collection with a discount.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967480/extras/56d2b8827fcf410fdb6e1d86de0e0a99.avif?t=1772762136\" width=706 height=232 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Baikal — </strong>a heartfelt visual novel about family, memory, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young woman traveling with her father to Lake Baikal — a place tied to their family’s past. On the way, a storm stands in their path, while an old photo album brings back memories of childhood, joy and loss, quarrels and reconciliation.<br>Will you find harmony in the storm of emotions?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎬 A personal and emotional story about the road, relationships, growing up, and memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 A linear narrative focused on the heroine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Two art styles: pixel art combined with a hand-drawn style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who love emotional visual novels like <i>To the Moon</i> or <i>Clannad</i>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Baikal — </strong>a heartfelt visual novel about family, memory, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young woman traveling with her father to Lake Baikal — a place tied to their family’s past. On the way, a storm stands in their path, while an old photo album brings back memories of childhood, joy and loss, quarrels and reconciliation.<br>Will you find harmony in the storm of emotions?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎬 A personal and emotional story about the road, relationships, growing up, and memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 A linear narrative focused on the heroine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Two art styles: pixel art combined with a hand-drawn style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who love emotional visual novels like <i>To the Moon</i> or <i>Clannad</i>.</p>",
